#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:3
#: 6860f83f10cf46b5a225662535e1a966
msgid "Flight Modes"
msgstr "飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:5
#: c495b8585f894eed905adebd64d3f95f
msgid ""
"Flight modes can be directly entered on the command line. This will send the"
" appropriate command to the autopilot. Use ``mode n`` to change mode, where "
"n is the desired mode. To get a list of available modes, enter ``mode``."
msgstr ""
"可直接在命令行输入飞行模式，这将向飞控发送相应命令。使用 ``mode n`` 切换模式，其中n为目标模式名称。输入 ``mode`` "
"可获取可用模式列表。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:10
#: 5524ecdd2f7f4d709dac5cf3cafee603
msgid "mode auto"
msgstr "mode auto"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:12
#: 8805ad80b6fb46f4a4ea1c1792c192cb
msgid "Enter AUTO mode, starting with the first waypoint."
msgstr "进入AUTO模式，从第一个航点开始执行。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:15
#: 156757ecc6f64332866e98c60c276db7
msgid "mode loiter"
msgstr "mode loiter"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:17
#: 3b1ba0d03ddc49d784ef1e35580f0156
msgid "Enter LOITER mode around the UAV's current position."
msgstr "进入LOITER模式，在无人机当前位置盘旋。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:20
#: b14af57efa1b45a38ea42a46bf18fbb4
msgid "mode rtl"
msgstr "mode rtl"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:22
#: 9820aff370d64381bffacb4f23e7fa5b
msgid "Enter Return to Launch mode."
msgstr "进入返航（Return to Launch）模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:25
#: d6f72c1b44c0478d89ce100996545239
msgid "mode manual"
msgstr "mode manual"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:27
#: 3cf05f2842b14fdb870efb946a464d5e
msgid "Enter manual mode. On ArduCopter this is equivalent to STABILIZE mode"
msgstr "进入手动模式。在ArduCopter上，此模式等同于STABILIZE模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:30
#: 18dd584d7ecb4522bc6b3b5c5f63e912
msgid "mode fbwa"
msgstr "mode fbwa"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:32
#: 3b39866c6cf94a9a9378b6ac01f5c09d
msgid "Enter Fly By Wire A mode. Applicable on fixed wing vehicles only."
msgstr "进入Fly By Wire A模式，仅适用于固定翼飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:35
#: b0c7ee7dc0df4f5eb7d3f21a798af20d
msgid "land"
msgstr "land"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:37
#: fe6aa1c19ddf45429c96403f7b72893f
msgid "Enter LAND mode. Note this is only applicable on fixed wing vehicles."
msgstr "进入LAND模式。注意，此模式仅适用于固定翼飞行器。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:39
#: 0b048727d7244ea29f81494aa564aa0e
msgid ""
"A specific mode is guided. By entering ``guided alt`` (where alt is the "
"desired altitude), the user can the select a point on the map window and the"
" UAV will immediately begin flying towards that point."
msgstr ""
"guided是一种特定模式。通过输入 ``guided alt`` （其中alt为目标高度），用户可在地图窗口中选择一个点，无人机将立即向该点飞行。"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:44
#: ad8f8ba079954bea99fe2c748cb248e7
msgid "guided"
msgstr "guided"

#: ../../source/docs/uav_configuration/flightModes.rst:46
#: 20be1054f12e42829a1dd6c84659c0c1
msgid ""
"Fly to the last clicked point on the map, or specified longitude and "
"latitude. Requires an altitude: ``guided ALTITUDE`` or ``guided LAT LON "
"ALTITUDE``"
msgstr ""
"飞往地图上最后点击的位置，或指定的经纬度。需要指定高度：``guided ALTITUDE`` 或 ``guided LAT LON "
"ALTITUDE``。"
